raco cql lib.cql                                         the ELM JSON
raco cql lib.cql –data patient/                          run it; every definition as name: value
raco cql lib.cql –data bundle.json –define Hypertensive  just the named definitions
raco cql lib.cql –data p/ –valuesets vs/                 ValueSet resources (with expansions) for the library's value sets
raco cql measure.cql –data p/ –libraries libs/           includes found as libs/<Name>.cql
raco cql –tck [-v]                                       the cqframework/cql-tests suite, floor-ratcheted
